{
  "_": [
    "Control snapshots the shipped web client produces, recorded so both sides",
    "of the R1 contract are tested against the same bytes.",
    "",
    "tests/playback/seek-control.test.js drives the real",
    "`playbackControlSnapshot` out of crates/plurxd/src/web/player/session.js",
    "and asserts it still emits exactly these. The Rust regression",
    "`seek_scratch_incumbent_survives_a_pending_replacement` feeds them to the",
    "real startup actor. Neither side can drift without the other failing.",
    "",
    "The protocol envelope (protocol/generation/control_epoch/sequence/",
    "client_instance_id/supported_actions) is added by makeRequest and by the",
    "Rust test; only the snapshot itself is recorded here."
